        "title": "Small Bodies",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "**Kirkwood gaps**: regions where orbital periods form simple integer ratios with Jupiter's (11.86 yr). Jupiter's gravitational perturbations at mean-motion resonances (MMRs) pump eccentricity until orbits become Mars-crossing → ejection."
    },
