      "text": "**Jupiter Trojans**: 1:1 MMR at Jupiter's L4/L5 (leading/trailing ~60°). ~10,000 known. P and D types — spectrally similar to outer belt + cometary nuclei. Lucy mission (launched 2021) will visit 8 Trojans 2025–2033."
