      "text": "**YORP effect** (Yarkovsky–O'Keefe–Radzievskii–Paddack): asymmetric thermal torque changes the *spin rate* of small asteroids. Can spin up small asteroids to fission frequency → binary formation or mass shedding. Directly measured on asteroid 1998 KY26 (Hayabusa2 target)."
