      "text": "**Rosetta mission** (ESA, 2004–2016): rendezvoused with 67P/Churyumov-Gerasimenko. Found: bilobed shape (two distinct lobes merged), very low density (0.53 g/cm³ → 70–80% porosity), D/H ratio = 3× standard mean ocean water (argues against comets being Earth's primary water source), complex organic molecules, seasonal jet activity."
